// ItemArt.js — hand-placed 16x16 item sprites in the vanilla item-icon style.
//
// All original pixel art. Each sprite is a template of palette letters:
//   material ramp   1 dark  2 mid  3 light  4 highlight
//   handle ramp     a dark  b mid  c light
//   accent ramp     x dark  y mid  z light   (gem inlays, grips, straps)
// Templates are recoloured per material. A 1px outline is added afterwards in
// the darkest shade of whichever ramp it borders, so silhouettes read the way
// vanilla icons do (dark-tinted edge, never flat black). Light comes from the
// top-left: highlight on upper/left edges, dark on lower/right.

// ── Ramps: [outline, dark, mid, light, highlight] ───────────────────────────
